PLIG-7376 FA: Loan Financial Account - Opt Out New Fields

Description

Description 
As a RM, I can view and manage the Loan Maturity Notification opt-out settings on the Loan Financial Account so that I can control whether Loan Maturity Email Notifications are sent for the loan.

Acceptance Criteria 
AC1: As a RM, when I'm viewing the Loan Financial Account Page, then I can see a new section called “Loan Maturity Notifications”

AC2: As a RM, when I'm viewing the Loan Financial Account Page, then I can see three new fields called “Opt Out Notifications”, “Opt Out Date & Time“ and “Opt Out Name“,  located under the new “Loan Maturity Notifications” section.

AC3: As a RM, when I'm viewing the Loan Financial Account Page, then I can only edit the “Opt Out Notifications” field if I’m the Loan Financial Account Owner and Loan Financial Account Owner Manager.

AC4: As a RM, when I'm viewing the Loan Financial Account Page, and I try to edit the “Opt Out Notifications” field and I’m not the Loan Financial Account Owner and Loan Financial Account Owner Manager then I receive the following error message: This setting can only be updated by the Loan Financial Account Owner or Financial Account Owner Manager. Please contact one of them if a change is needed.

AC5: As a RM, when I edit the “Opt Out Notifications” field, then the “Opt Out Date & Time“ and “Opt Out Name“ field are automatically updated with the current date and time and the user name that made the update accordingly.

Field Information

Field Type

Permission

Label: Opt Out Notifications

API Name: BKU_Opt_Out_Notifications_c

Description: Controls whether Loan Maturity Email Notifications are sent for this Loan Financial Account.

Help text: Yes - Select “Yes” to stop future Loan Maturity Email Notifications.

Picklist:

Yes

No

Read Only for CRMA

Edit for RM (Loan Financial Account Owner), Admin and ETL

 
Label: Opt Out Date & Time

API Name: BKU_Opt_Out_Date_Timee_c

Description: Stores the date and time when the Opt Out Notifications preference was last updated.

Help text: No

Date/Time

Read Only for RM and CRMA

Edit for Admin and ETL

Read Only in the user layout

 
Label: Opt Out Name

API Name: BKU_Opt_Out_Name_c

Description: Stores the name of the user who last updated the Opt Out Notifications preference.

Help text: No

Lookup (User)

Read Only for RM and CRMA

Edit for Admin and ETL

Read Only in the user layout



Note:

The Officer 3 on the Financial Account will not be able to update the Opt Out Notifications as this functionality should only be available for Financial Account Owner and Financial Account Owner Manager - The email templates can remain the same but if the Officer 3 clicks the unsubscribe in the email no action should be performed.


