Acceptance Criteria 
AC1: As an RM, when the system date is 6 Months (180 days) prior to the Loan End Date (Maturity Date) field of the Financial Account Loan record type, 

AND the Balloon Loan = Yes,

AND the Opt Out Notifications = No,

AND the Financial Account Owner is not equal to "DataLoad Bank United Data", 

AND the Financial Account Owner Division is equal to “Commercial Banking”,

then the system will send an email notification (Initial Notification) to the Financial Account Owner, the Financial Account Owner Manager and the Officer 3 of the Loan Financial Account (only if they Financial Account Owner User is from Commercial Banking division) including the following information:

