PLIG-7329 FA: Maturity Date Notification Opt Out



Description

Description 
As an RM, when receiving the Loan Maturity Emails, I want the ability to opt out of the notifications from the Email directly so that I no longer receive maturity reminders and escalation emails when the loan renewal process is already in progress or the notifications are no longer needed.

Acceptance Criteria 
AC1: As a recipient* of a Loan Maturity Email Notification, when I receive a 1-Month (30-Day), 2-Month (60-Day), 3-Month (90-Day), or 4-Month (120-Day) Loan Maturity Email Notifications, then the email includes an Unsubscribe option that allows me to stop receiving future Loan Maturity Notifications for the related Loan Financial Account.

AC2: As a recipient of a Loan Maturity Email Notification, when I click Unsubscribe from Loan Maturity Notifications from the 4-Month (120-Day) Loan Maturity Email Notification, then the related Loan Financial Account is automatically updated as follows:

Opt Out Notifications = Yes

Opt Out Date & Time = Current date and time

Opt Out Name = User who performed the update

And no future Loan Maturity Email Notifications are sent for that Loan Financial Account.

AC3: As a recipient* of a Loan Maturity Email Notification, when I click Unsubscribe from Loan Maturity Notifications from the 3-Month (90-Day) Loan Maturity Email Notification, then the related Loan Financial Account is automatically updated as follows:

Opt Out Notifications = Yes

Opt Out Date & Time = Current date and time

Opt Out Name = User who performed the update

And no future Loan Maturity Email Notifications are sent for that Loan Financial Account.

AC4: As a recipient* of a Loan Maturity Email Notification, when I click Unsubscribe from Loan Maturity Notifications from the 2-Month (60-Day) Loan Maturity Email Notification, then the related Loan Financial Account is automatically updated as follows:

Opt Out Notifications = Yes

Opt Out Date & Time = Current date and time

Opt Out Name = User who performed the update

And no future Loan Maturity Email Notifications are sent for that Loan Financial Account.

AC5: As a recipient* of a Loan Maturity Email Notification, when I click Unsubscribe from Loan Maturity Notifications from the 1-Month (30-Day) Loan Maturity Email Notification, then the related Loan Financial Account is automatically updated as follows:

Opt Out Notifications = Yes

Opt Out Date & Time = Current date and time

Opt Out Name = User who performed the update

And no future Loan Maturity Email Notifications are sent for that Loan Financial Account.

Note:

Recipient* = Loan Financial Account Owner and Loan Financial Account Owner Manager

When Opt Out Notifications is set to Yes, Loan Maturity Notifications are suppressed for all recipients associated with the Loan Financial Account.

The Officer 3 on the Financial Account will not be able to Unsubscribed as this functionality should only be available for Financial Account Owner and Financial Account Owner Manager - The email templates can remain the same but if the Officer 3 clicks the unsubscribe in the email no action should be performed.
